{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51734","headline":"寄杭州宋使君（公初罢睦州） · 贯休","name":"寄杭州宋使君（公初罢睦州）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一自双旌下钓台，望风吟苦冻云开。\n即归紫闼天非远，犹忆乌龙首独回。\n高节似僧僧共坐，暮潮如雪雪中来。\n应知新定苍生泪，洒向东风祝上台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}